==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Li'l Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Mr. Mole]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*30 [[Li'l Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
*1 [[H. Nah]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is nasty. Despite none of the enemies here being particularly strong, the Li'l Doge spam introduces a lot of RNG into the stage and can be very annoying. Now might be a good time to bring Manic Macho Legs into the lineup.

